OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen brings 84mph wind
OL,4,Agusts as thousands of UK homes without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Austen is causing widespread
OL,8,Fpower cuts and travel disruption ` with
OL,9,Fwind gusts of 84mph (135km/h) recorded
OL,10,Fat Jersey Airport
OL,12,FMore than 18,000 homes in parts of
OL,13,FEngland and Wales are without power as
OL,14,Fmillions remain under a yellow weather
OL,15,Fwarning for wind
OL,17,FGreat Western Railway (GRW) says speed
OL,18,Flimits will be in place on routes
OL,19,Fbetween Devon and Cornwall until 13:00
OL,20,FBST while Network Rail Scotland says
OL,21,Ftrains will be slowed down along parts
OL,22,Fof the West and East coast main lines
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
